      "finding": "Insider selling of $148.96M with zero buys across the last 20 Form 4 filings, including a director selling $38.5M in two tranches on March 24 2026, represents a consistent, broad-based liquidation signal — not an anomaly — at prices materially below current consensus targets.",
      "evidence": "[Source: FMP /insider-transactions] Aggregate net insider position: -$148.96M; director Mark Stevens sold 221,682 shares at ~$173-175 on 2026-03-24; director Aarti Shah sold 19,000 shares at ~$176-178 on 2026-03-20; zero insider purchases across all 20 recent filings"
