    {
      "finding": "ROA of 65.7% TTM is exceptional for a semiconductor company at this scale, reflecting asset-light model and extreme earnings power relative to the balance sheet.",
      "evidence": "[Source: FMP /key-metrics] ROA 65.7% TTM; combined with D/E of 0.07 confirms equity-funded growth with minimal leverage risk"
